            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Raw materials",
            "content": "<p>In the world of high-end luxury rugs, the difference between good and extraordinary begins with material. At Corvo, we take time with this choice. Every fiber is selected for how it feels, how it wears over time, and how it lives in a space, not just how it looks.</p><p>We work with a wide range of exceptional fibers, from refined plant-based yarns and fine cottons to natural wools chosen for their strength and comfort. Each rug is built as a balanced composition, where texture, weight, and light come together naturally. </p>",
