        "eyebrow": "The making",
        "title": "From the yarn to the finished rug",
        "text": "<p>Every Corvo rug is made in our atelier in Silvalde, in the north of Portugal. The yarn is chosen and dyed, the design is tufted by hand, and the pile is cut and finished by the people who make it.</p>",
        "button_1_text": "Craftsmanship",
