    "process-flow": {
      "type": "process-flow",
      "blocks": {
        "step-materials": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Raw materials",
            "text": "<p>Every fibre is selected for how it feels, how it wears over time and how it lives in a space, not just how it looks. We work with refined plant-based yarns, fine cottons and natural wools chosen for their strength and comfort.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CORVO_FINAL-19.jpg",
            "image_alt": "Hanks of undyed yarn, the raw material of a Corvo rug",
            "link_text": "Discover the raw materials",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/raw-materials"
          }
        },
        "step-colours": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Colours",
            "text": "<p>Choose from our Open Palette or develop a tone of your own through Infinite Colours. In our colour laboratory every hue is engineered, and every batch of yarn is tested in-house for colourfastness and consistency.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CORVO_FINAL-22.jpg",
            "image_alt": "A technician measuring red dye in the colour laboratory",
            "link_text": "Discover the colours",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/colours"
          }
        },
        "step-service": {
          "type": "step",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Service",
            "text": "<p>It starts with a personal consultation, where our team works with you on fibres, structure, pile height, colours and shape. Then come the artwork for your approval, a sample, production and delivery.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2026-01-05_at_20.18.57_4.jpg",
            "image_alt": "A designer drawing the artwork of a rug on a tablet, beside small yarn samples in blues and greens",
            "link_text": "Discover the service",
            "link_url": "shopify://pages/bespoke-service"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "step-materials",
        "step-colours",
        "step-service"
      ],
