        "eyebrow": "Our story",
        "title": "More than a century of textiles in the family",
        "text": "<p>Two families of textile makers meet in Corvo, Ferreira de Sá and Relvas. Joaquim Ferreira de Sá founded his rug manufacture in 1947, and Ramiro Relvas began the Sorema group in 1974.</p><p>That knowledge now goes into one thing only: rugs tufted by hand in Silvalde, in the north of Portugal, where every piece passes through the hands of the people who make it.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/HISTORIA_-_IMG_6672.jpg",
